purpose operation main "useRetry retries while the call returns a negative value; counter walks -2 -> -1 -> 0; result of the successful attempt prints."
invariant operation main "Without retry, output would be -2 after a single attempt. With retry, the loop runs 3 times until the call returns 0 (not negative)."
